[Desktop Entry]
Version=1.0
Type=Application
Name=Fix DNS
Name[zh_CN]=一键修复DNS
Comment=Probe working public DNS servers and pin them
Comment[zh_CN]=探测可用的公共 DNS 并写入 /etc/resolv.conf
